or PLC in Franklin County","/arc-plc/arkansas/franklin-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025, April to May ran 159% of normal on the middle, but November to December fell to 36%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 50% and February to March at 53% on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1963.</p>"}
